        "The selected product matters too. A bulky box can travel differently from a soft garment. Restricted or battery-powered items may have fewer routes. A multi-item order can wait for the slowest item or be split, depending on the current process. Do not copy another customer’s timeline unless the destination, service and order structure are genuinely comparable.",
