        "Customs and import treatment varies by destination and product. Hacoos does not calculate duties or provide legal customs advice. Read the current checkout information and local authority guidance, especially for electronics, batteries, cosmetics or other restricted categories. If a carrier requests documentation, verify the request through its official channel before sharing personal information. Do not send payment or identity documents to somebody who contacts you only through an unverified message.",
